---
---

<div class="border-b border-rule">
  <div class="section py-24" style="max-width: 1120px;">
    <div class="eyebrow">Real responses</div>
    <h2
      class="mt-5 font-bold tracking-tight text-ink"
      style="font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.04em;"
    >
      A dead end becomes a conversation.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[600px] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Over the limit, a caller gets a token and a link to the next request. Come back, ask
      again, get a real answer.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-11 flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-5">
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_440px] overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-[var(--color-code-bg)]" style="background: var(--color-code-bg);">
        <div class="mono border-b px-[22px] py-3 text-xs" style="border-color: var(--color-code-border); background: var(--color-code-header); color: #b9b6ae;">
          real response · POST /api/accessgate/evaluate
        </div>
        <pre class="mono m-0 overflow-x-auto px-[22px] py-5 text-[13px] leading-[1.75]" style="color: var(--color-code-text);"><code><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"outcome"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-amber)">"Queued"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"callerType"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-text)">"Agent"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"granted"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-coral)">false</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"leaseToken"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-violet)">"061F6A05…70CA"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"reason"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-text)">"rate_limit_exceeded"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="background:rgba(62,230,196,.10); border-radius:3px"><span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"links"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span>
    <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"poll"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"href"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-mint)">"/api/accessgate/poll"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"method"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-text)">"POST"</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span></span>
<span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span></code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_440px] overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] border border-[var(--color-code-bg)]" style="background: var(--color-code-bg);">
        <div class="mono border-b px-[22px] py-3 text-xs" style="border-color: var(--color-code-border); background: var(--color-code-header); color: #b9b6ae;">
          62 s later · POST /api/accessgate/poll
        </div>
        <pre class="mono m-0 overflow-x-auto px-[22px] py-5 text-[13px] leading-[1.75]" style="color: var(--color-code-text);"><code><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"granted"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-mint)">true</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"leaseToken"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-violet)">"ea530bb0…1c0c92"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"reason"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-text)">"poll_granted_within_rate_limit"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span>
  <span style="background:rgba(62,230,196,.10); border-radius:3px"><span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"links"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span>
    <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"complete"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"{"}</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"href"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-mint)">"/api/accessgate/complete"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">,</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-key)">"method"</span><span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">:</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-text)">"POST"</span> <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span>
  <span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span></span>
<span style="color:var(--color-code-punc)">{"}"}</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 gap-y-6 rounded-[6px] border border-rule bg-paper-2 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_320px]">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Transport</div>
        <div class="mono mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-ink">
          <span class="rounded-[4px] px-3 py-2" style="background: var(--color-tag);">HTTP</span>
          <span class="rounded-[4px] px-3 py-2" style="background: var(--color-tag);">gRPC</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Call the gate over HTTP or gRPC — whichever your sidecar already speaks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_320px]">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="letter-spacing: 0.08em;">Native SDKs</div>
        <div class="mono mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-ink">
          <span class="rounded-[4px] px-3 py-2" style="background: var(--color-tag);">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="rounded-[4px] px-3 py-2" style="background: var(--color-tag);">.NET</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Available today for JavaScript and .NET.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
